<PageLayout title="How we make money" lead="This site is free to read. Here is how it pays for itself.">
  <p>
    Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you click one and sign up for a product, the provider may pay us a
    commission. You pay the same price either way. Affiliate links are marked, and buttons that lead to a provider say
    “affiliate”.
  </p>
  <h2>What this does not change</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Providers cannot pay to be included, ranked higher or reviewed more positively.</li>
    <li>We also mention options that pay us nothing, including public insurers and the tax office’s own tools.</li>
    <li>If a product is not a good fit for most freelancers, we say so.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>No personal advice</h2>
  <p>
    We explain and compare. We do not broker insurance or give tax advice for your personal situation. For that, please
    talk to a licensed insurance broker or a tax advisor.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
